{"Empty `data` object `{}` passed to `updateMany` likely won't update `updatedAt` - pass `{ updatedAt: new Date() }` explicitly": 0.9284375905990601, "`sed -i ''` is macOS (BSD sed) specific and will fail on Linux (GNU sed) - consider using a portable pattern": 0.9186100959777832, "The `deleteCacheMutation` does not invalidate the `connectedCalendars` query after success, so the UI will continue showing the stale cache status until a manual page refresh": 0.991798996925354, "Filter out `null`/`undefined` values from `credentialIds` before passing to the repository - `cal.credentialId` is typed as `number | null | undefined`, but `getCacheStatusByCredentialIds` expects `number[]`": 0.9578609466552734, "Use `TRPCError` with an appropriate code (e.g., `NOT_FOUND`) instead of a plain `Error` - a plain `Error` is mapped to `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` (500) by tRPC": 0.8538999557495117, "`cleanup` unconditionally exits with code 0, masking failures - when called after rate-limit detection or URL extraction failure, the script should exit non-zero": 0.8352264761924744, "`ENV_FILE=\"../.env\"` is relative to the working directory, not the script's location - running the script from any directory other than `scripts/` will target the wrong `.env` file": 0.9742833375930786, "`tsx` is not a declared dependency - `npx tsx` will download it on the fly which can fail in restricted-network/CI environments": 0.5365275144577026, "The date formatter hardcodes `\"en-US\"` instead of using the user's locale - pass the appropriate locale to `Intl.DateTimeFormat` for consistent i18n": 0.8219152688980103, "The input schema is defined inline, breaking the established convention where every route has a dedicated `.schema.ts` file - extract it to a `deleteCache.schema.ts` file": 0.004507275763899088, "Wrong Prisma input type for `updateMany` - `SelectedCalendarUpdateInput` permits relational/nested writes that `updateMany` silently ignores, use `SelectedCalendarUpdateManyMutationInput` instead": 0.7657225131988525, "`googleChannelId` is fetched in the session query but never consumed downstream - this adds an unnecessary database column to every authenticated request's session lookup": 0.21257759630680084, "`utils` is declared after `deleteCacheMutation` but should be declared before it since `deleteCacheMutation` will need `utils` for query invalidation": 0.8976565003395081}